WEBVTT

00:17:25.447 --> 00:17:31.046
poštenje, radna etika, ljubav —

00:17:31.046 --> 00:17:35.370
i puštamo da se sreća 
i samopoštovanje pobrinu sami za sebe.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:37.414
MIslim da kada bismo svi to činili,

00:17:37.414 --> 00:17:40.955
djeca bi i dalje bila dobro

00:17:40.955 --> 00:17:43.601
kao i njihovi roditelji,

00:17:43.601 --> 00:17:47.569
možda čak i bolje.

00:17:47.569 --> 00:17:49.448
Hvala vam.

00:17:49.448 --> 00:17:52.248
(Pljesak)